          "id": "ae8c85544bc369d512268f3984fa9fd67340371f",
          "message": "revive automap: batch map accounts for free (#12135)\n\nChanges:\n- Add TX to pallet revive to allow anyone to map accounts\n\nThe new TX `batch_map_accounts`:\n- Maps a batch of accounts without taking a deposit\n- Releases existing mapping deposits of accounts\n- Is free to send when at least 90% of accounts were not already mapped\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Oliver Tale-Yazdi <oliver.tale-yazdi@parity.io>\nCo-authored-by: cmd[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Paolo La Camera <paolo@parity.io>",
